solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">High</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“High”</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">High price for the day.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Low</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“Low”</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Low price for the day.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Volume</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“Volume”</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Trading volume for the day for the selected contract (Volume for US Stocks are quoted in lots. The actual number of shares in volume can be calculated by multiplying 100).</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Close Price</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“Close”</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">The last available closing price for the previous day. For US Equities, we use corporate action processing to get the closing price, so the close price is adjusted to reflect forward and reverse splits and cash and stock dividends.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Open Price</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“Open”</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Today’s opening price. The official opening price requires a market data subscription to the native exchange of a contract.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Last Exchange</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“LastExch”</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">The exchange where the Last Price is provided from.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Bid Exchange</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“BidExch”</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">The exchange where the Bid Price is provided from.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Ask Exchange</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“AskExch”</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">The exchange where the Ask Price is provided from.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Last Timestamp</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“LastTime”</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Time of the last trade (in UNIX time).</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Halted</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“Halted”</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Indicates if a contract is halted. See&nbsp;<a href=\"https://interactivebrokers.github.io/tws-api/tick_types.html#halted\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(10