rder-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Model Price of Underlying</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“ModelUndPrice”</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">The current model price of the option underlying.</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">注意</span>：如果您没有相应的<a href=\"https://interactivebrokers.github.io/tws-api/market_data.html#market_subscriptions\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(103, 149, 181); text-decoration-line: none;\">市场数据订阅</a>，如果您请求上述实时价格变动类型，将显示&quot;0&quot;。如果您有兴趣，请参阅<a href=\"https://interactivebrokers.github.io/tws-api/rtd_simple_syntax.html#rtd_simple_syntax_delayed_ticks\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(103, 149, 181); text-decoration-line: none;\">延迟逐笔报价类型</a>。<em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">需要 API 版本 9.73.05 或更高版本才能请求期权希腊语数据。</em></p><h5 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 8px 0px 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); font-size: 16px;\"><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(78, 161, 219);\"></a>通用分时类型</h5><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\">TWS RTD 服务器 API 中还支持选择<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">通用数据类型</span>。要请求任何<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">通用数据类型</span>，您只需在 RTD 公式中将通用数据类型的名称指定为<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Topic</span>字符串即可。</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\">例如，以下公式将请求IBM@SMART的 52 周最高价：</p><pre style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Anonymous Pro&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 22px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">=RTD(&quot;Tws.TwsRtdServerCtrl&quot;,,&quot;IBM@SMART&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;Week52Hi&quot;)</pre><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\">有关当前支持的<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">通用逐笔报价类型</span>的完整列表，请参见下表：</p><table width=\"731\"><thead style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\" class=\"firstRow\"><th style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; background-color: rgb(239, 243, 245); word-break: normal !important;\">Generic Tick Type Name</th><th style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; background-color: rgb(239, 243, 245); word-break: normal !important;\">Topic String</th><th style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; background-color: rgb(239, 243, 245); word-break: normal !important;\">Description</th><th style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; background-color: rgb(239, 243, 245); word-break: normal !important;\">Generic Tick Required</th></tr></thead><tbody style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px;\"><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Auction Volume</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“AuctionVolume”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">The number of shares that would trade if no new orders were received and the auction were held now.</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">225</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Auction Imbalance</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“AuctionImbalance”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">The number of unmatched shares for the next auction; returns how many more shares are on one side of the auction than the other.</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">225</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Auction Price</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“AuctionPrice”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">The price at which the auction would occur if no new orders were received and the auction were held now. The indicative price for the auction.</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">225</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Regulatory Imbalance</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“RegulatoryImbalance”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">The imbalance that is used to determine which at-the-open or at-the-close orders can be entered following the publishing of the regulatory imbalance.</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">225</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td style=\"box-sizi