, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">588</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Average Option Volume</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“AvgOptVolume”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Average volume of the corresponding option contracts (TWS Build 970+ is required)</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">105</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\">默认情况下，将自动请求所有<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">通用价格变动类型</span>。用户只需直接指定<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">主题</span>作为通用刻度类型的名称，即可将数据填充到 Excel。</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\">为了消耗更少的数据资源并使您的市场数据请求更有效率，您可以通过定义字符串*“genticks=id1，id2,…”*直接指定要请求的<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">通用逐笔报价类型</span>。</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\">例如，要请求 52 周最高价，只需要<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">通用分时类型</span>= 165。以下公式将仅请求<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">通用分时类型</span>= 165：</p><pre style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Anonymous Pro&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 22px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">=RTD(&quot;Tws.TwsRtdServerCtrl&quot;,,&quot;IBM@SMART&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;Week52Hi&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;genticks=165&quot;)</pre><h5 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 8px 0px 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); font-size: 16px;\"><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(78, 161, 219);\"></a>延迟逐笔报价类型</h5><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\">当实时流市场数据因缺少<a href=\"https://interactivebrokers.github.io/tws-api/market_data.html#market_subscriptions\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(103, 149, 181); text-decoration-line: none;\">市场数据订阅</a>而不可用时，延迟的数据将自动中继回来。要通过 RTD 请求延迟数据，您需要为<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">主题</span>指定延迟逐笔报价类型。下表显示了可用延迟逐笔报价类型的完整列表：</p><table width=\"731\"><thead style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\" class=\"firstRow\"><th align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; background-color: rgb(239, 243, 245); word-break: normal !important;\">Tick Name</th><th style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; background-color: rgb(239, 243, 245); word-break: normal !important;\">Topic String</th><th style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; background-color: rgb(239, 243, 245); word-break: normal !important;\">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px;\"><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Delayed Bid Size</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“DelayedBidSize”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Number of contracts (or lots) offered at the bid price.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Delayed Bid Price</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“DelayedBid”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Highest bid price for the contract.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Delayed Ask Price</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“DelayedAsk”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Lowest offer price for the contract.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Delayed Ask Size</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“DelayedAskSize”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Number of contracts (or lots) offered at the ask price.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Delayed Last Price</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“DelayedLast”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Last price at which the contract traded.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Delayed Last Size</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“DelayedLastSize”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Number of contracts or lots traded at the last price.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Delayed High</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“DelayedHigh”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">High price for the day.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Delayed Low</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“DelayedLow”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Low price for the day.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Delayed Volume</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“DelayedVolume”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Trading volume for the day for the selected contract (Volume for US Stocks are quoted in lots. The actual number of shares in volume can be calculated by multiplying 100).</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Delayed Close Price</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“DelayedClose”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">The last available closing price for the previous day. For US Equities, we use corporate action processing to get the closing price, so the close price is adjusted to reflect forward and reverse splits and cash and stock dividends.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Delayed Open Price</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“DelayedOpen”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Today’s opening price. The official opening price requires a market data subscription to the native exchange of a contract.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Delayed Last Timestamp</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“DelayedLastTimestamp”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Delayed time of the last trade (in UNIX time) (TWS Build 970+ is required).</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\">例如，以下公式将从 Island Exchange 请求 IBM 的延迟买入价：</p><pre style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Anonymous Pro&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 22px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">=RTD(&quot;Tws.TwsRtdServerCtrl&quot;,,&quot;IBM@ISLAND&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;DelayedBid&quot;)</pre><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">注意</span>：<em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">延迟逐笔报价类型为延迟 15 分钟。在没有市场数据订阅的情况下请求实时即时报价类型将导致错误消息&quot;请求的市场数据未订阅。显示延迟的市场数据…&quot;</em></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\">查看更多<a href=\"https://interactivebrokers.github.io/tws-api/rtd_examples.html\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(103, 149, 181); text-decoration-line: none;\">语法示例</a>。</p><h5 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 8px 0px 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); font-size: 16px;\"><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(78, 161, 219);\"></a>连接参数</h5><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\">由于TWS RTD服务器API直接引用C#API客户端，因此它通过socket连接到TWS（或IB网关）与C#相同。<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">主机 IP 地址</span>、<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">套接字端口</span>和<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">客户端 ID</span>是启动socket连接的必需参数。</p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 0px; overflow: auto hidden;\" class=\" list-paddingleft-2\"><li><p><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">主机 IP 地址</span>是运行 TWS 的 IP 地址。对于本地连接，可以使用本地 IP 127.0.0.1。</p></li><li><p>socket端口是用于socket连接的端口。您可以在<a href=\"https://interactivebrokers.github.io/tws-api/initial_setup.html#enable_api\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(103, 149, 181); text-decoration-line: none;\">TWS API 设置</a>中设置主机端口，并且需要将 API 连接到在 TWS 中设置的同一端口。</p></li><li><p><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">客户端 ID</span>是每个 API 连接的标识。TWS 最多可以维护 32 个 API 客户端同时连接，并且客户端 ID 用于区分每个连接。这最初旨在使API用户可以使用不同的策略同时运行多个API程序（即客户端）来单独交易。由于 TWS RTD 服务器 API 仅用于中继实时数据，因此无需使用多个客户端 ID。</p></li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\">如果用户未直接指定，则上述三个参数默认为以下值：</p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 0px; overflow: auto hidden;\" class=\" list-paddingleft-2\"><li><p><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">主机</span>= “127.0.0.1” （即 “localhost”）</p></li><li><p><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">端口</span>= “7496”</p></li><li><p><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">客户端 ID</span>&nbsp;= 整数.最大值 - 1</p></li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\">简单语法支持多个预定义的<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">连接参数</span>，这些参数可以在 RTD 公式中指定为单独的字符串（即 String2、String3…）：</p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 0px; overflow: auto hidden;\" class=\" list-paddingleft-2\"><li><p><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">“paper”</em>：改用 port=7497 进行连接（7497 是模拟TWS 会话 的默认端口）</p></li><li><p><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">“gw”</em>：请改用 port=4001 进行连接（4001 是实盘 IB 网关会话的默认端口）</p></li><li><p><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">“gwpaper”</em>：改用 port=4002 进行连接（4002 是模拟 IB 网关会话的默认端口）</p></li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\">例如，要在通过端口 7497 连接到使用模拟帐户记录的 TWS 时请求IBM@SMART的&quot;高价&quot;：</p><pre style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Anonymous Pro&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 22px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">=RTD(&quot;Tws.TwsRtdServerCtrl&quot;,,&quot;IBM@ISLAND&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;High&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;paper&quot;)</pre><h4 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 8px 0px 16px; line-height: 26px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); font-size: 18px;\"><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(78, 161, 219);\"></a>复杂语法</h4><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\">复杂语法提供了最大的灵活性，它允许用户单独自定义所有公式字符串，其中每个字符串仅表示一个参数。每个参数的出现顺序没有规则。</p><pre style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Anonymous Pro&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 22px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">=RTD(ProgID,&nbsp;Server,&nbsp;String1,&nbsp;String2,&nbsp;String3...)</pre><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\">参数</p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 0px; overflow: auto hidden;\" class=\" list-paddingleft-2\"><li><p><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">ProgID</span>&nbsp;= “Tws.TwsRtdServerCtrl”</p></li><li><p><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">服务器</span>= “” （空字符串）</p></li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\">例如，下面的公式将请求IBM@ISLAND的&quot;询问大小&quot;：</p><pre style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Anonymous Pro&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 22px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">=RTD(&quot;Tws.TwsRtdServerCtrl&quot;,,&quot;sym=IBM&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;sec=STK&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;exch=ISLAND&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;qt=AskSize&quot;)</pre><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\">以下公式将请求 IBM 的买入价：</p><pre style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Anonymous Pro&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 22px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">=RTD(&quot;Tws.TwsRtdServerCtrl&quot;,,&quot;sym=ES&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;sec=FUT&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;exch=GLOBEX&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;cur=USD&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;exp=201712&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;qt=Bid&quot;)</pre><h5 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 8px 0px 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); font-size: 16px;\"><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(78, 161, 219);\"></a>复杂语法字符串</h5><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\">有关可用复杂语法字符串的完整列表，请参阅下表：</p><table width=\"731\"><thead style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\" class=\"firstRow\"><th style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; background-color: rgb(239, 243, 245); word-break: normal !important;\">Name</th><th style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; background-color: rgb(239, 243, 245); word-break: normal !important;\">String Syntax</th><th style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; background-color: rgb(239, 243, 245); word-break: normal !important;\">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px;\"><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Contract ID</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“conid=”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">The unique contract ID generated by IB. Can be found at TWS&nbsp;<a href=\"https://interactivebrokers.github.io/tws-api/contracts.html\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(103, 149, 181); text-decoration-line: none;\">Contract Description</a>&nbsp;.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Symbol</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“sym=”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">The contract symbol.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">SecurityType</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“sec=”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">The type of security, e.g. ‘STK’, ‘FUT’ and so on.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">LastTradeDateOrContractMonth</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“exp=”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Format ‘YYYYMMDD’ is used for defining the Last Trade Date, while format ‘YYYYMM’ is used for defining the Contract Month.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Strike</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“strike=”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">The strike price for an option contract.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Right</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“right=”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">‘C’ or ‘P’ for an option contract.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Multiplier</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“mult=”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">The contract multiplier.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Exchange</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“exch=”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">The exchange where to get market data from. For equities, ‘SMART’ means top data from all possible exchanges.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">PrimaryExchange</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“prim=”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">The primary exchange of the contract. It is mostly specified when an contract ambiguity occurs for equity symbols that are listed on multiple exchanges.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Currency</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“cur=”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">The currency the contract is traded in.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">LocalSymbol</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“loc=”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">The local symbol of the contract. Note the Local Symbol is mostly used for futures and options, and is different from the Symbol.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">TradingClass</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“tc=”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">The trading class of the contract.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Combo</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“cmb=”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Combo contract has to be defined using Complex Syntax or Mixed Syntax. The syntax for defining the combo is: “cmb=###;###;” ,where combo legs are separated by ‘;’ and individual leg parameters are separated by ‘#’. See more&nbsp;<a href=\"https://interactivebrokers.github.io/tws-api/rtd_examples.html#rtd_samples_spread\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(103, 149, 181); text-decoration-line: none;\">Spread Samples</a>&nbsp;.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">DeltaNeutralContract</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“und=”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Delta-Neutral Contract. The syntax for defining the delta-neutral contract is: “und=&lt;##” , where delta-neutral contract parameters are separated by ‘#’.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">MktDataOptions</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“opt=”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Currently not supported.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">GenericTickList</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“genticks=”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">A comma separated Ids of available Generic Tick Types.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Topic</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“qt=”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Topic of market data request.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\"><br/></td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\"><br/></td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\"><br/></td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Host</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“host=”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Host IP address.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Port</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“port=”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">Socket port.</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">ClientId</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">“clientid=”</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">The client ID for socket connection. Note that the client ID is used for identify multiple simultaneous API connections to the same TWS. It was originally designed for API users who would like to manage their strategies separately from different API programs. Since the TWS RTD Server API is currently only supported for real-time market data, there is no need to use multiple client IDs.</td></tr></tbody></table><h5 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 8px 0px 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); font-size: 16px;\"><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(78, 161, 219);\"></a>混合语法</h5><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\">复杂语法可以与<a href=\"https://interactivebrokers.github.io/tws-api/rtd_simple_syntax.html\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(103, 149, 181); text-decoration-line: none;\">简单语法</a>混合使用，只有一个限制，即<a href=\"https://interactivebrokers.github.io/tws-api/rtd_simple_syntax.html#rtd_simple_syntax_ticker\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(103, 149, 181); text-decoration-line: none;\">Ticker</a>字符串必须是 RTD 公式中出现的第一个字符串（即 String1）。</p><pre style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Anonymous Pro&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 22px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">=RTD(ProgID,&nbsp;Server,&nbsp;Ticker,&nbsp;String2,&nbsp;String3...)</pre><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\">参数</p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 0px; overflow: auto hidden;\" class=\" list-paddingleft-2\"><li><p><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">ProgID</span>&nbsp;= “Tws.TwsRtdServerCtrl”</p></li><li><p><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">服务器</span>= “” （空字符串）</p></li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\">例如，以下公式将在通过自定义主机、端口和客户机 ID 进行连接时请求 IBM 的买入价：</p><pre style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Anonymous Pro&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 22px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">=RTD(&quot;Tws.TwsRtdServerCtrl&quot;,,&quot;IBM@SMART&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;host=1.2.3.4&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;port=1234&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;clientId=1&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;Bid&quot;)</pre><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\">查看更多<a href=\"https://interactivebrokers.github.io/tws-api/rtd_examples.html\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(103, 149, 181); text-decoration-line: none;\">语法示例</a>。</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\">TWS RTD 服务器示例</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\">本页演示了按安全类型和语法类型分类的 RTD 公式。在查看示例之前，请务必熟悉 RTD 公式的各种可用语法。</p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 0px; overflow: auto hidden;\" class=\" list-paddingleft-2\"><li><p><a href=\"https://interactivebrokers.github.io/tws-api/rtd_simple_syntax.html\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(103, 149, 181); text-decoration-line: none;\">简单语法</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://interactivebrokers.github.io/tws-api/rtd_complex_syntax.html\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(103, 149, 181); text-decoration-line: none;\">复杂语法</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://interactivebrokers.github.io/tws-api/rtd_mixed_syntax.html\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(103, 149, 181); text-decoration-line: none;\">混合语法</a></p></li></ul><h4 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 8px 0px 16px; line-height: 26px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); font-size: 18px;\"><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(78, 161, 219);\"></a>外汇对</h4><h5 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 8px 0px 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); font-size: 16px;\"><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(78, 161, 219);\"></a>- 简单的语法</h5><pre style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Anonymous Pro&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 22px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">=RTD(&quot;Tws.TwsRtdServerCtrl&quot;,,&quot;EUR.USD/CASH&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;Bid&quot;)</pre><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\"><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">评论：外汇代码以&quot;CURRENCY1.货币2/现金&quot;。</em></p><h5 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 8px 0px 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); font-size: 16px;\"><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(78, 161, 219);\"></a>- 复杂语法</h5><pre style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Anonymous Pro&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 22px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">=RTD(&quot;Tws.TwsRtdServerCtrl&quot;,,&quot;sym=EUR&quot;,&quot;cur=USD&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;exch=IDEALPRO&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;sec=CASH&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;qt=Bid&quot;)</pre><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\"><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">注释：对于复杂语法，外汇<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">符号</span>被定义为外币，<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">货币</span>被定义为基础货币。</em></p><h5 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 8px 0px 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); font-size: 16px;\"><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(78, 161, 219);\"></a>- 混合语法</h5><pre style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Anonymous Pro&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 22px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">=RTD(&quot;Tws.TwsRtdServerCtrl&quot;,,&quot;EUR.USD/CASH&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;Bid&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;port=1234&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;clientId=1&quot;)</pre><h4 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 8px 0px 16px; line-height: 26px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); font-size: 18px;\"><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(78, 161, 219);\"></a>股票</h4><h5 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 8px 0px 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); font-size: 16px;\"><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(78, 161, 219);\"></a>- 简单的语法</h5><pre style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Anonymous Pro&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 22px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">=RTD(&quot;Tws.TwsRtdServerCtrl&quot;,,&quot;IBM&quot;)</pre><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\"><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">注释：使用默认值：<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">交易所</span>= “SMART”，<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">货币</span>= “USD”，<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">安全类型</span>= “STK”，<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">主题</span>= “最后”。</em></p><pre style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Anonymous Pro&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 22px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">=RTD(&quot;Tws.TwsRtdServerCtrl&quot;,,&quot;IBM@ISLAND&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;Bid&quot;)</pre><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\"><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">注释：直接指定<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Exchange</span>意味着专门从该交易所请求数据。</em></p><pre style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Anonymous Pro&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 22px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">=RTD(&quot;Tws.TwsRtdServerCtrl&quot;,,&quot;BMO@SMART//////CAD&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;Bid&quot;)</pre><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\"><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">注释：货币 = “CAD” 对于在 TSE 上列出的 BMO 是必需的，但其余字段可以留空。</em></p><pre style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Anonymous Pro&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 22px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">=RTD(&quot;Tws.TwsRtdServerCtrl&quot;,,&quot;ABG.P@SMART//////EUR&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;Close&quot;)</pre><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\"><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">注释：简单语法也支持包含&quot;.&quot;的常用符号。</em></p><pre style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Anonymous Pro&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 22px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">=RTD(&quot;Tws.TwsRtdServerCtrl&quot;,,&quot;MSFT@SMART/ISLAND&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;Ask&quot;)</pre><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\"><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">注释：对于某些具有相同<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">符号</span>、<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">货币</span>和<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">交换</span>的智能路由股票合约，您还需要指定<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">PrimaryExchange</span>属性来唯一定义合约。这应该被定义为合约的原生交换，并且是所有股票的良好做法。</em></p><h5 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 8px 0px 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); font-size: 16px;\"><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(78, 161, 219);\"></a>- 复杂语法</h5><pre style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Anonymous Pro&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 22px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">=RTD(&quot;Tws.TwsRtdServerCtrl&quot;,,&quot;sym=IBM&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;sec=STK&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;exch=SMART&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;cur=USD&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;qt=Volume&quot;)</pre><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\"><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">评论：一般来说，使用<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">符号</span>，<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">证券类型</span>=“STK”，<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">货币</span>和<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">交换</span>足以定义股票。</em></p><pre style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Anonymous Pro&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 22px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">=RTD(&quot;Tws.TwsRtdServerCtrl&quot;,,&quot;sym=MSFT&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;sec=STK&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;exch=SMART&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;cur=USD&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;prim=ISLAND&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;qt=Open&quot;)</pre><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\"><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">注释：将<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">PrimaryExchange</span>指定为单独的字符串以解决协定多义性。</em></p><h5 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 8px 0px 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); font-size: 16px;\"><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(78, 161, 219);\"></a>- 混合语法</h5><pre style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Anonymous Pro&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 22px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">=RTD(&quot;Tws.TwsRtdServerCtrl&quot;,,&quot;MSFT@SMART&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;prim=ISLAND&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;qt=High&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;paper&quot;)</pre><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\"><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">注释：使用预定义的字符串*“paper”*连接到纸质TWS会话的默认端口7497。</em></p><h4 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 8px 0px 16px; line-height: 26px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); font-size: 18px;\"><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(78, 161, 219);\"></a>指标</h4><h5 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 8px 0px 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); font-size: 16px;\"><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(78, 161, 219);\"></a>- 简单的语法</h5><pre style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Anonymous Pro&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 22px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">=RTD(&quot;Tws.TwsRtdServerCtrl&quot;,,&quot;SPX@CBOE//IND&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;Last&quot;)</pre><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden;\"><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">注释：默认<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">货币</span>= 使用&quot;美元&quot;。</em></p><pre style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, &quot;Anonymous Pro&quot;, &quot;Droid Sans Mono&quot;, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 1.2em; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 22px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">=RTD(&quot;Tws.TwsRtdServerCtrl&quot;,,&quot;DAX@DTB//IND////EUR&quot;,&nbsp;&quot;Last&quot;)</pre><h5 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 8px 0px 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); font-size: 16px;\"><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-co