或 0（假）</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">等待为填充</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">等待当前订单完成，然后再提交下一个订单</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">1（真）或 0（假）</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); background-color: rgb(247, 247, 247);\"><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">activeTimeStart</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">算法开始时间</td><td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(79, 79, 79); line-height: 22px; vertical-align: middle; word-break: normal !important;\">YYYYMMDD-hh:mm:ss TMZ</td></tr><tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 1px 0px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-bottom-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial;